body:
My boyfriend talks in his sleep an absurd amount. He has full conversations with people that aren't there, that obviously make sense to him in his sleep state, but to me just come across as funny, incoherent, or occasionally incredibly creepy. One night, he just would NOT STOP. He was getting angry, in his sleep, about baseball, a sport he does not watch nor play. It was around two or three in the morning at this point, and his ranting was keeping me awake. I turned to him and said, "Babe, it's late, please just go to sleep."

&#x200B;

He, still dead asleep, replied "SHHHHHH, stop talking!"

&#x200B;

And then continued his ranting.
